	"FriendlyName": "GSTN Parts Minion",
	"Description": "Bridge between GSTNParts and GSTNMinion (plan P15 to P16): destructible parts for minions, so hundreds of small enemies can lose a head and keep fighting. P15 is the interface only, an empty module that depends on the pure halves of both plugins; the store columns, the hit flow glue and the wire byte come in P16. The pure pieces (8 part limit, FGSTN_PartsMinionExtension, the store to snapshot builder) live in GSTNPartsCore. Enabling it changes nothing.",
